    "text": "A body cools from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> minutes. Its temperature comes down to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>33</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> in the next <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> minutes. The temperature of the surroundings is",
